Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Kong Drum Designer
//
//  Pads 1-8   -> Kong drums 1-8        (Bank A)
//  Pads 9-16  -> reserved              (Bank B)
//  Knobs 1-4A -> Kong master section   (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B -> Kong bus/FX section   (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X -> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y -> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard   -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	Kong Drum Designer
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"KONG"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (Bank A) --------------------------------
Map	Pad 1		Pad 1
Map	Pad 2		Pad 2
Map	Pad 3		Pad 3
Map	Pad 4		Pad 4
Map	Pad 5		Pad 5
Map	Pad 6		Pad 6
Map	Pad 7		Pad 7
Map	Pad 8		Pad 8

// Pads 9-16 (Bank B) are reserved. Kong only offers 8 trigger pads.
// Uncomment once you add a drum-dedicated second Kong or a Redrum duo.
//Map	Pad 9		Pad 9
//Map	Pad 10		Pad 10
//Map	Pad 11		Pad 11
//Map	Pad 12		Pad 12
//Map	Pad 13		Pad 13
//Map	Pad 14		Pad 14
//Map	Pad 15		Pad 15
//Map	Pad 16		Pad 16

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): master section ----------
Map	Knob 1 A		Master Level
Map	Knob 2 A		Master FX P1
Map	Knob 3 A		Master FX P2
Map	Knob 4 A		Master FX On

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): bus/FX section ----------
Map	Knob 1 B		Bus FX P1
Map	Knob 2 B		Bus FX P2
Map	Knob 3 B		Bus FX On
Map	Knob 4 B		Level Bus FX to Master FX

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel

// --- Patch navigation (needs a spare button; default off) ---
//Map	Pad 9		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 10		Select Next Patch